1. PURPOSE & SCOPE
1.1 Purpose
This Enterprise Information Security Policy (EISP) establishes mandatory administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to ensure the Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability (CIA Triad) of organizational data assets.
1.2 Scope
This policy applies universally to:
All full-time, part-time, contract, and third-party personnel.
All cloud, hybrid, and on-premises infrastructure managed by or on behalf of the enterprise.
All endpoints, database systems, network devices, and electronic communications facilities.
